<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="RM0550J">
<servcat id="10">
<name>Body &amp; Electrical</name>
<section id="1001A_S0009" variety="S0009">
<name>Lighting</name>
<ttl id="1001A_S0009_7420N_T0015" variety="T0015">
<name>Lighting System</name>
<para id="RM000002ZZ0000X" category="C" type-id="8031F" name-id="603KY-00" from="200612">
<dtccode>B2452</dtccode>
<dtcname>Height sensor data error during initialization</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM000002ZZ0000X_01" type-id="33" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___000066J00000">
<name>Function Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>This DTC is output when the sensor value obtained from the height control sensor assembly (rear) during the initialization of the headlight leveling computer assembly is outside the valid range. For example, this applies when the vehicle is tilted significantly or when the vehicle is jacked up.</ptxt>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="3.43in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="2.28in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC No.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Diagnosis Description</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Inspection Area</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B2452</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Abnormal vehicle posture during initialization</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Vehicle posture during initialization</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Headlight Leveling Computer Assembly</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000002ZZ0000X_02" type-id="51" category="05" proc-id="RM0550J___000066K00000">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>After replacing the headlight leveling computer assembly, initialization is necessary. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000030GL000X"/>)</ptxt>
</atten4>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000002ZZ0000X_03" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM000002ZZ0000X_03_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___000066L00000">
<testtitle>Initialize Headlight Leveling Computer Assembly</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Initialize the headlight leveling computer assembly. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000030GL000X"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<atten4>
<ptxt>Check that the vehicle posture allows initialization to be performed normally.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000002ZZ0000X_03_0002" fin="false">NEXT</down>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000002ZZ0000X_03_0002" proc-id="RM0550J___000066M00000">
<testtitle>Recheck DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), recheck the DTCs.</ptxt>
</test1>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.01in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.12in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>No DTC output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>DTC "B2452" is output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<atten4>
<ptxt>If B2452 is output even when initialization is performed with the vehicle posture normal, the headlight leveling computer assembly may be malfunctioning.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000002ZZ0000X_03_0003" fin="true">A</down>
<right ref="RM000002ZZ0000X_03_0004" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000002ZZ0000X_03_0003">
<testtitle>Complete</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000002ZZ0000X_03_0004">
<testtitle>Replace Headlight Leveling Computer Assembly<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000001X8N001X"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
</tmc-service-inc>